<div dir=3D"auto"><div dir=3D"auto">How&#39;s that for a fun email title lo=
l</div><div dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">*Brief Note* Sorry for=
 no email last week! I had a lot of things that I did manage to write, but =
it wasn=E2=80=99t the whole week, and I didn=E2=80=99t want to send somethi=
ng that felt incomplete. I have plenty of time to finish things up though, =
so it should be a nice long email treat =F0=9F=98=8E</div><div dir=3D"auto"=
><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">This week we were honored to spend the week in=
 a trio with my 2 Transfer Earlier Companion, Mackay=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81=EF=
=BC=81As a zone leader he has definitely locked in a bit more and is really=
 focusing on missionary work. I love this! We were only able to go housing =
