near the end. We talked more about how important God plays a role in our li=
ves, and invited Romeo to talk more with us about it when we get the chance=
. We learned a bit more of his religious background, turns out he&#39;s alw=
ays been a member of the Hindu faith back in Nepal, but as he=E2=80=99s bee=
n away from home and also recovering from a past addiction (pretty sure thi=
s was back in Nepal) hes learned a bit from a teacher with Christian backgr=
ound and agrees much more with the idea of a merciful and loving God. He sa=
id he didn&#39;t yet read from the Book of Mormon, but hopefully soon we ca=
n re-extend that offer to him. He&#39;s already agreed to show up to our Sa=
crament meeting when his schedule permits, which is amazing. We&#39;ll just=
 have to wait a few weeks and hopefully things will really get moving with =
