 place the whole game =F0=9F=98=8E heck yeah</div><div dir=3D"auto">Today&#=
39;s fruit Basket also insane. Literally more than 10 big bags of Furugura.=
 I shouldn&#39;t have put it on the list of things we want but now I also h=
ave enough to last me 2-3 transfers on my own =F0=9F=98=82</div><div dir=3D=
"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">For Pday, we went to Aeon mall With Mack=
