un.</div><div dir=3D"auto"><br></div><div dir=3D"auto">Tuesday</div><div di=
r=3D"auto">Today we had in Person DCM in Sennan, it was fun. We ate as a di=
strict at a Chinese noodle restaurant, which was also pretty cool. I Owed W=
