inder that things don&#39;t just happen on their own. I got dressed and all=
 ready to go at a =E2=80=9Creasonable time=E2=80=9D but never really encour=
aged my companion or suggested verbally that we do anything. It&#39;s annoy=
ing to feel like I&#39;m making all the decisions and I don&#39;t want to b=
e my comp&#39;s mother, but it&#39;s also easy to get stuck in that mindset=
