uejhiro=E5=A7=89=E5=A6=B9 and her husband, which was so fun. They are both =
so sweet, and I even got to geek out about some cool Japanese artists I lik=
e with the husband. (go And listen to VAUNDY his music is so dope) We also =
had Baskin Robins ice cream back at their house, which was my first time in=
 Japan. It was pretty good but as i looooce ice cream, those serving were N=
OT enough. Just kidding it was enough =F0=9F=98=82</div><div dir=3D"auto"><=
br></div><div dir=3D"auto">Sunday we didn&#39;t go to the church to see Gen=
eral Conference (I didn&#39;t know we had it and Magbago=E9=95=B7=E8=80=81=
